  "question": {
    "text": "In open interval $\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$,"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\cos x+x \\sin x    < 1$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\cos x+x \\sin x>1$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "no specific order relation can be ascertained between $\\cos x+x \\sin x$ and 1",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\cos x+x \\sin x    < \\frac{1}{2}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\n$f(x)=\\cos x+x \\sin x-1$\r\n$\\Rightarrow f^{\\prime}(x)=-\\sin x+\\sin x+x \\cos x>0 ; x \\in\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$\r\n$\\Rightarrow f(x)$ is increasing function\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\Rightarrow f(x)>f(0) \\\\\r\n\\cos x+x \\sin x-1>0 \\\\\r\n\\cos x+x \\sin x>1\r\n\\end{array}$"
  }
}